Value Filldown LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value Required CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value PORT_ID (.+?)
Value PORT_DESC (.+?)
Value SYSTEM_NAME (.+?)
Value SYSTEM_DESC (.+?)
Value MGMT_ADDRESS (\S+)

Start
  ^${LOCAL_INTERFACE} has \d+ neighbor
  ^\s*Neighbor index\s*:\s*\d+ -> Clear
  ^\s*Chassis ID\s*:\s*${CHASSIS_ID}
  ^\s*Port ID\s*:\s*${PORT_ID}\s*$$
  ^\s*Port description\s*:\s*${PORT_DESC}\s*$$
  ^\s*System name\s*:\s*${SYSTEM_NAME}\s*$$
  ^\s*System description\s*:\s*${SYSTEM_DESC}\s*$$
  ^\s*Management address(?: value)?\s*:\s*${MGMT_ADDRESS}
  ^\s*Expired time\s*: -> Record
